@startuml sequence-notification-dispatch

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title SIMDP - Sequence: Pengiriman Notifikasi\n(In-App & Email dari Event Domain)

autonumber

actor "User (Penerima)" as User
participant "Domain Service\n(mis. VerificationService\natau DocumentService)" as DomainSvc
participant "NotificationService" as NotifSvc
database "PostgreSQL\n(Tabel Notification)" as DB
participant "Email Provider\n(SMTP / API)" as Email
participant "UI Browser\n(Panel Notifikasi)" as Browser

== Skenario 1: Notifikasi Terkirim Sukses (In-App + Email) ==

note over DomainSvc
  Contoh pemicu:
  - Dokumen disetujui / ditolak (VerificationService)
  - Dokumen berhasil diunggah (DocumentService)
  - Dokumen mendekati kadaluarsa (Cron Reminder)
  - Dokumen kadaluarsa otomatis (Cron Expiry)
end note

DomainSvc -> NotifSvc : sendNotification({\n  userId,\n  type,\n  title,\n  message,\n  relatedEntityId\n})
activate NotifSvc

NotifSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO Notification\n(userId, type, title, message,\nisRead=false, relatedEntityId)
activate DB
DB --> NotifSvc : Notifikasi tersimpan (id)
deactivate DB

NotifSvc -> Email : sendEmail({\n  to: user.email,\n  subject: title,\n  body: message\n})
activate Email

alt Email terkirim sukses
    Email --> NotifSvc : 200 OK / accepted
    deactivate Email
    NotifSvc --> DomainSvc : { success: true }
    deactivate NotifSvc

    note right of DomainSvc
      Domain Service melanjutkan proses utamanya.
      Kegagalan notifikasi TIDAK membatalkan
      transaksi bisnis utama (upload / verifikasi).
    end note

else Email gagal terkirim (SMTP error / timeout)
    Email --> NotifSvc : Error / timeout
    deactivate Email
    NotifSvc -> NotifSvc : log warning: EMAIL_SEND_FAILED\n(notifikasi in-app tetap tersimpan di DB)
    NotifSvc --> DomainSvc : { success: false, inAppSaved: true }
    deactivate NotifSvc

    note right of NotifSvc
      Fallback: notifikasi in-app sudah tersimpan
      sehingga user tetap bisa membaca notifikasi
      lewat panel di UI meskipun email gagal.
    end note
end

== Skenario 2: User Membaca Notifikasi In-App ==

User -> Browser : Buka panel / halaman notifikasi
Browser -> DB : GET /api/v1/notifications\n(query: userId, isRead=false)
DB --> Browser : Daftar notifikasi belum dibaca

User -> Browser : Klik salah satu notifikasi
Browser -> DB : PATCH /api/v1/notifications/:id/read\n(UPDATE isRead = true)
DB --> Browser : OK
Browser --> User : Tampilkan detail notifikasi\n& tandai sudah dibaca

@enduml
